# Cloudflare Pages redirects file.
# Format: <from>  <to>  <status_code>
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Pretty URLs (/demo, /privacy, /terms) are handled NATIVELY by Cloudflare
# Pages — when /demo is requested, it auto-resolves to demo.html, and
# /demo.html is auto-redirected to /demo (.html stripping). Adding our own
# rewrite rules here was creating a redirect loop with that built-in
# behaviour, so the only entries below are real redirects (3xx) for
# legacy paths.

# Drop the legacy github.io demo path if anything still hits it
/pfi-engine      /demo              301
/pfi-engine/*    /demo              301
